```{list-table} CompetentAuthority
:name: RBDCA_CompetentAuthority
:width: 100%
:header-rows: 1

* - Attribute
  - Data type
  - Definition

* - euCACode
  - {term}`wiseIdentifier`
  - Unique European code for the Competent Authority.  
    Required.

* - competentAuthorityName
  - String(100)
  - Official name of the Competent Authority in English.  
    Required.  
    Only Latin characters are allowed.

* - competentAuthorityNameNL 
  - String(100) 
  - Official name of the Competent Authority in the Member State’s national language.  
    Required.

* - competentAuthorityNameNLLanguage 
  - {term}`LanguageCode`
  - Language used for reporting the name of the Competent Authority 
    in a national language.

* - acronym 
  - String(100) 
  - Acronym for the Competent Authority (if it exists).  
    Optional. 

* - street 
  - String(100) 
  - Street name where Competent Authority is located in latin characters.  
    Required.
    Only Latin characters are allowed.

* - city 
  - String(100) 
  - City where Competent Authority is located in latin characters. 
    Required.
    Only Latin characters are allowed.

* - country 
  - String(100) 
  - Country where the Competent Authority is located in English.  
    Required.
    Only Latin characters are allowed.

* - postCode 
  - String(50) 
  - Postcode address of the Competent Authority.  
    Required.
    Only Latin characters are allowed.

* - url 
  - {term}`URL`
  - Website address of the Competent Authority.  
    Required.